-- Install option "HQ Sin Mine", after GeroyAnekdotov's WALO SIN HQ: while the actor plays Sin in
-- warfare, the Red Forest mine red_smart_terrain_3_2 replaces the surface camp as the Sin main base
-- and gets a medic and barman (jobs in mod_red_smart_terrain_3_2_warfare.ltx; the trader and the
-- mechanic are simulation.ltx's story squads, replaced through mod_red_greh_*_warfare.ltx), a
-- workbench, medic corner, bar and sleep spot. Not under ReDone, which moves the Sin base.
-- Read by warfare_player_hqs.

local k = warfare_base_props.kit

